OL,3,GNEWSAPeople 'still feel vulnerable' to
OL,4,Awinter floods
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe founder of a flood action group has
OL,7,Fsaid people "still feel very
OL,8,Fvulnerable" to flooding despite work to
OL,9,Fstrengthen defences nearly 11 years
OL,10,Fafter Storm Desmond.
OL,12,FLis Dales, from Castle Street Community
OL,13,FFlood Action Group in Kendal, said the
OL,14,Ftown was "so far behind where we need
OL,15,Fto be to give us a reasonable level of
OL,16,Fsecurity".
OL,18,FWork on the Kendal Flood Risk
OL,19,FManagement Scheme began in 2021 and was
OL,20,Fdue to finish in 2025, but the town
OL,21,Fcentre section is now expected to be
OL,22,Ffinished in 2028.
OL,23,APub: 21-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,402,400,260,160,0,100
