OL,3,GNEWSAPeople 'still feel vulnerable' to
OL,4,Awinter floods
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Environment Agency (EA) said town
OL,7,Fcentre defences were 70% complete and
OL,8,Fthe majority of flood gates and new
OL,9,Fpumps were ready should they be needed
OL,10,Fthis winter.
